(7691765, 1260584, 173844, '<td valign="top">Perhaps this lovely photograph speaks to me because I''m so familiar with this path alongside the reservoir in Central Park, NYC, and have many times visited it.  Maybe not, as it''s beautiful without any personal connection.  My wife, Shelley, and I have so very much enjoyed our strolls here, in springtime and otherwise.  I treasure these memories you have evoked for me, in these days without.  The cherry tree blossoms fill the world.<br/>Personal favorite of the challenge.<br/> <br/>(this is a rewrite of the comment I stupidly blew up when I tried to change my 8 to a 10 in the last minute of the evening)</td>', 'Perhaps this lovely photograph speaks to me because I''m so familiar with this path alongside the reservoir in Central Park, NYC, and have many times visited it.  Maybe not, as it''s beautiful without any personal connection.  My wife, Shelley, and I have so very much enjoyed our strolls here, in springtime and otherwise.  I treasure these memories you have evoked for me, in these days without.  The cherry tree blossoms fill the world.Personal favorite of the challenge. (this is a rewrite of the comment I stupidly blew up when I tried to change my 8 to a 10 in the last minute of the evening)', '2021-04-16 01:14:13.000000', NULL, 0),
