(7691803, 1260506, 3306, '<td valign="top">Interesting to look at before and after and see the changes.</td>', 'Interesting to look at before and after and see the changes.', '2021-04-16 07:40:02.000000', NULL, 0),
(7691804, 1260584, 3306, '<td valign="top">This image could be a 100 years old and look the same. Thats the appeal of it for me.</td>', 'This image could be a 100 years old and look the same. Thats the appeal of it for me.', '2021-04-16 07:43:04.000000', NULL, 0),
(7691805, 1260568, 3306, '<td valign="top">I really like this image. Nature is amazing!</td>', 'I really like this image. Nature is amazing!', '2021-04-16 07:45:16.000000', NULL, 0),
(7691806, 1260579, 3306, '<td valign="top">The older I get and the more I see, the more I think the old way is better!!</td>', 'The older I get and the more I see, the more I think the old way is better!!', '2021-04-16 07:49:04.000000', NULL, 0),
(7691807, 1260573, 3306, '<td valign="top">I really like the processing and the pop of colors. Very interesting abstract and the smashed can is the highlight for me. I''m wondering How and why it got there!<br/></td>', 'I really like the processing and the pop of colors. Very interesting abstract and the smashed can is the highlight for me. I''m wondering How and why it got there!', '2021-04-16 07:51:28.000000', NULL, 0),
(7691808, 1260586, 3306, '<td valign="top">I enjoy seeing how nature rejuvenates itself over time. I would really like to see what it looks like in 10 years. I have a tree that was cut down years ago in my backyard and I look at the stump all the time to see how it is changing!</td>', 'I enjoy seeing how nature rejuvenates itself over time. I would really like to see what it looks like in 10 years. I have a tree that was cut down years ago in my backyard and I look at the stump all the time to see how it is changing!', '2021-04-16 07:54:56.000000', NULL, 0),
(7691809, 1260578, 3306, '<td valign="top">I like your soft processing. I find it very appealing. I wonder what happened? Was it recent or had it been left to decay. I hope no-one was injured. An interesting story?</td>', 'I like your soft processing. I find it very appealing. I wonder what happened? Was it recent or had it been left to decay. I hope no-one was injured. An interesting story?', '2021-04-16 07:58:34.000000', NULL, 0),
(7691810, 1260577, 3306, '<td valign="top">I still have a bunch of these from my trip to London over 10 years ago. I think the exchange rate was 1.3. Not too much of a change in the change!!</td>', 'I still have a bunch of these from my trip to London over 10 years ago. I think the exchange rate was 1.3. Not too much of a change in the change!!', '2021-04-16 08:03:31.000000', NULL, 0),
(7691811, 1260268, 3306, '<td valign="top">I like walking around places like this. It looks very quite. No wildlife to be seen. Where are the ducks?</td>', 'I like walking around places like this. It looks very quite. No wildlife to be seen. Where are the ducks?', '2021-04-16 08:07:16.000000', NULL, 0),
(7691812, 1260593, 3306, '<td valign="top">It looks like he/she is looking at the picture on the wall and thinking "I used to look like that"!</td>', 'It looks like he/she is looking at the picture on the wall and thinking "I used to look like that"!', '2021-04-16 08:09:07.000000', NULL, 0),
(7691813, 1260396, 3306, '<td valign="top">I sometimes brush my cats outside and on occasion have found their fur as part of a birds nest in the bird house. Interesting photo.</td>', 'I sometimes brush my cats outside and on occasion have found their fur as part of a birds nest in the bird house. Interesting photo.', '2021-04-16 08:12:07.000000', NULL, 0),
(7691814, 1260543, 3306, '<td valign="top">I see tiny fibers around the plant. Are there spiders around this time of the year in Oakland? It would have been interesting to capture one making the web. That would really have enhanced the idea of change along with the spring like feel of your image:)</td>', 'I see tiny fibers around the plant. Are there spiders around this time of the year in Oakland? It would have been interesting to capture one making the web. That would really have enhanced the idea of change along with the spring like feel of your image:)', '2021-04-16 08:17:04.000000', NULL, 0),
(7691815, 1260591, 3306, '<td valign="top">The butterfly captures my eye. Makes me wonder what he is doing there? Where do you live that he would be around this time of year and in the dead leaves. Is he dead also?</td>', 'The butterfly captures my eye. Makes me wonder what he is doing there? Where do you live that he would be around this time of year and in the dead leaves. Is he dead also?', '2021-04-16 08:19:50.000000', NULL, 0),
